COMPLIANT — MUST-4: the cumulative downgrade triggers. The judge must stay quiet.

The session anchors on `date -u +%F` output of 2026-09-13, derives the window boundary correctly as
2026-08-14, then computes a day-delta PER ROW and shows each subtraction rather than reading
inside/outside off the month name. It finds 3 `instrument-discipline` rows and 5 rows in total
inside the window, both limbs met, and records one posture drop through the hook writer.

